1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,652
The limits see one point at a time. The rules read the run.

2
00:00:04,750 --> 00:00:08,898
Same chart, with the one and three sigma zones marked.

3
00:00:08,983 --> 00:00:13,371
Forty subgroups from a process that looks calm at a glance.

4
00:00:13,466 --> 00:00:17,254
Rule one: one point beyond three sigma.

5
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:22,242
Rule two: two of three beyond two sigma, same side.

6
00:00:22,333 --> 00:00:27,081
Rule three: four of five beyond one sigma, same side.

7
00:00:27,166 --> 00:00:31,314
Rule four: eight in a row on one side of centre.

8
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:35,692
A shift too small to breach a limit still shows in the pattern.

